{"id":18220,"name":"Bay County","slug":"bay-county","state":"Michigan","code":"MI","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/bay-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:50:30","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deed Sale","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","deposit":"$1,000 hold on a credit card","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"August and October"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Treasurer’s Office"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Tax-Sale.info"},{"label":"County Website","value":"County Official Website"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"uLTSJhX4DcFZVf8vEjHy2NCgQta5mpM7eYP1ioRKWGlsqO0wUAx3z6\"><iframe title=\"Properties at 40-90% Off: Don&#039;t Miss Out! - Bay County - Michigan Tax Deed Investing\" width=\"563\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XtTAphN10sY?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Properties-at-40-90%-Off:-Don't-Miss-Out!---Bay-County,-Michigan-Tax-Deed-Investing\">Properties at 40-90% Off: Don&#8217;t Miss Out! &#8211; Bay County, MI</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Introduction:</strong> Looking for an incredible real estate deal? Bay County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan&#8217;s</mark></a> tax deed auction is the place to be! You can find properties for 40 to 90% off the market value. Everything happens online at <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax-Sale.info</mark></a>. </p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-understanding-tax-deed-auctions\">Understanding Tax Deed Auctions </h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A tax deed auction is where the county sells properties that have unpaid property taxes. The winning bidder gets the deed to the property, often at a significant discount. For example, you might pick up a house valued at $100,000 for just $40,000.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-steps-to-start-tax-deed-investing-in-bay-county\">Steps to Start Tax Deed Investing in Bay County</h2>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It’s crucial to know the legal framework in Bay County. Local laws and regulations affect your investment, so make sure you stay informed.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer’s Website</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Check out the Bay County Treasurer&#8217;s <a href=\"https://www.baycounty-mi.gov/Treasurer/Property-Auctions.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Property Auctions</mark></a> page for all the details you need about upcoming sales.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Bay County’s auctions are hosted on <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax-Sale.info</mark></a>, where you can see available properties and start bidding.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Read the Details about Tax Deeds</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Understand the auction terms and conditions. The auction sells properties as-is, so you must do your due diligence.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You can contact the Bay County Treasurer’s Office directly for any additional inquiries.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-important-details\">Important Details</h4>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bay-County-Building.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bay-County-Building-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bay-County-Building-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bay-County-Building-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bay-County-Building-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bay-County-Building-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bay-County-Building.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bay-County-Building.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bay-County-Building-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bay-County-Building-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bay-County-Building-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bay-County-Building-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bay-County-Building-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18234 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Bay County Building\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-pro-tips\">Pro Tips</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Do Your Homework</strong>: Research each property thoroughly before bidding. Use resources like the <a href=\"https://bsaonline.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">BS&amp;A Online</mark></a> for property tax information.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Understand the Costs</strong>: Winning bids include a 10% premium, the current year&#8217;s summer taxes, and a $30 deed fee.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Payment</strong>: You have five business days to pay via wire transfer, certified check, or credit card.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-attractions-and-economic-highlights\">Attractions and Economic Highlights </h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Bay County isn&#8217;t just about great real estate deals. The area offers plenty of attractions and economic opportunities:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Popular Attractions</strong>: Visit parks, theatres, and historic sites.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Transportation Infrastructure</strong>: Excellent road, rail, and air transport links.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Economic Development</strong>: Key sectors include agriculture, technology, mining, and manufacturing.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Community Appeal</strong>: Enjoy outdoor recreational activities, entertainment options, and historical attractions.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-faqs\">FAQs</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>How do I participate in the auction?</strong> You need to register on <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax-Sale.info</mark></a> and place a $1,000 hold on your credit card.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>What are the payment options?</strong> Payments can be made via wire transfer, certified check, or credit card.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>What happens if I don’t pay?</strong> The $1,000 hold on your credit card will be charged if you win and fail to complete the purchase.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>For more information, visit the <a href=\"https://www.baycounty-mi.gov/Treasurer/Property-Auctions.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Bay County Treasurer’s Page</mark></a> or the <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">auction site</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p